    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0wzsy5c",
      "content": "<img></img>This chapter explains the rise of Jainism and Buddhism in Ancient India. These religions emerged in the 6th century BCE as a reaction against ritualism and social inequalities of the Later Vedic period. "
    },
